# Pinned build argument of deploy/docker/ocr.Dockerfile (M-103; decisions 118, 157, 167). release.yml passes it as
# --build-arg and records this file next to the image SBOM, together with the image's /licenses/OS-PACKAGES.txt (the
# exact Tesseract, Leptonica and language-data package versions the snapshot resolved) for the licence and source-offer
# records. An empty value BLOCKS the release (never a guess): set it as a reviewed change with a download line.
#   UBUNTU_SNAPSHOT  snapshot.ubuntu.com id YYYYMMDDTHHMMSSZ; every apt call of the build resolves against it
UBUNTU_SNAPSHOT=
